---
code: records-headerless-refused
when-fires: a records stream carried no terminal token anywhere, so it carried no framing at all. plan/records.rs admit_records (the strict admission path); the forgiving deframer emits it too. Static.
why: 27D E4: a real dorc probe always frames, so a headerless stream is corruption or an alien source — refuse (kFAIL-withhold, the fold is withheld, the host runs).
edit-loop: edit a sentence in the transcript below, then run `mise run loom:compile -- records-headerless-refused && mise run loom:promote -- records-headerless-refused`; prove it stuck with `mise run test`, which is also what catches anything else the promotion moved. `mise run loom:vars -- --all records-headerless-refused` lists this case's values; type {{name}} to insert or move one.
---
